      <main>
        <h2>Delivery Information</h2>

        <p>
          At Bookmore, we aim to process and deliver your orders quickly and efficiently. Below you'll find information
          about order processing, shipping methods, estimated delivery times, and order tracking.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Order Processing</strong>
          Once your order has been placed and payment has been successfully confirmed, our team begins preparing your
          books for dispatch. <br>

          Orders are processed Monday to Friday (excluding public holidays). <br>
          Most orders are processed within 1–2 business days. <br>
          During busy periods, such as holidays or special promotions, processing times may be slightly longer. <br>

          You'll receive a confirmation email once your order has been shipped.
        </p>

        <p>
          <strong>Shipping Methods</strong>
          We offer a range of delivery options to suit your needs. <br>

          <u>Standard Delivery</u> <br>
          Delivery within 3–7 business days <br>
          Available for most destinations <br>
          Affordable shipping rates <br>
          <u>Express Delivery</u> <br>
          Delivery within 1–3 business days <br>
          Ideal for urgent orders <br>
          Additional shipping charges apply <br>
        </p>


      </main>
